        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion BT-G2, Oil Rubbed Bronze Manor Leverset with Round Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Brass Manor Lever with Round Rose features a rustic oil rubbed bronze finish. With its classic styling, it will compliment almost any traditional home. The Manor Leverset with  Round Rose will fit  doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will adjust to fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches thick. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sandcasting</b> is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten brass is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Rock Ridge Collection Sandcast Brass Manor Lever with Beveled Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Fusion BT Manor Lever with G2 Beveled Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
