                "description": "Fusion BT-G2, Sandcast Brass Manor Lever with Round Rose - The Sandcast Brass Manor Lever with Round Rose features a rustic oil rubbed bronze finish. With its classic styling, it will compliment almost any traditional home. The Manor Leverset with  Round Rose will fit  doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will adjust to fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches thick. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
